					<description>Bees descended from the outskirts of Hallownest, hailing from Crystal Peaks. These bees were interbred with Quarry Bees to assist in Hallownest's extrraction operations. Originally bred, with Queen Vespa's blessing, to aid the massive mining operations of Crystal Peaks' singing pink crystals, they, like their kin, colonized the galaxy with other Hallownest creatures. Crystal Peak Bees, like Quarry Bees, extract stones from the landscape as they gather pollen. In this case, though, they are attracted to the faint singing hum of Crystal Peak Pink Crystals, and will bring them back to their hives. Processing a Crystal Peak Bee honeycomb will yield Crystal Peak Pink Crystals, Heavy Beeswax, and normal honey. \n \n Like their Hive Land counterparts, all Hallownest bees were originally servants of Queen Vespa, an enormous, sapient insect, these bees were scattered across the galaxy as humans colonized alongside CrystalPeak races. The Infection followed soon after, further causing them to distribute their range. As with all Hallownest bees, Crystal Peak Bees' "queens" are evolved forms of female Hive Knights that regained flight, rather than royal offspring of Queen Vespa. Without their queen, these "Hive Dames" took the role of making more Crystal Peak Bees.. \n\n\n\n\n Bee Traits: \n\n 	Production time: 1 day \n 	Works at Night: Yes \n 	Works When Raining: No \n 	Unusual Sources Needed: No \n 	Minimum Temperature: 0ºF (-17.7778ºC) \n 	Maximum temperature: 113ºF (45ºC)</description>
